#: ../../intro/install.rst:5
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:7
msgid ""
"ANet is installed as a single static binary named ``anet`` (``anet.exe`` "
"on Windows). The installer downloads the binary for the platform, checks "
"it against a signed release manifest, and writes it to a directory on the"
" search path. No compiler, language runtime or superuser privilege is "
"required for a per-user installation. Linux and macOS use the shell "
"script ``install.sh``; Windows uses the PowerShell script ``install.ps1``"
" (see :ref:`intro-install-windows`)."
msgstr ""
"ANet 以名为 ``anet``\\ （Windows 上为 "
"``anet.exe``）的单个静态二进制文件安装。安装程序下载适用于当前平台的二进制文件，依据已签名的发布清单对其校验，并写入搜索路径上的某个目录。按用户安装无需编译器、语言运行时或超级用户权限。Linux"
" 和 macOS 使用 shell 脚本 ``install.sh``；Windows 使用 PowerShell 脚本 "
"``install.ps1``\\ （参见 :ref:`intro-install-windows`）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:17
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "本页内容"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:22
#: ../../intro/install.rst:607
msgid "Requirements"
msgstr "环境要求"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:24
msgid "Supported platforms"
msgstr "支持的平台"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:25
msgid ""
"Linux, macOS, and Windows 10 version 1809 or later or Windows Server 2019"
" or later, each on amd64 and arm64. Windows runs the native Windows "
"build; WSL2 is not required."
msgstr ""
"amd64 与 arm64 架构上的 Linux、macOS，以及 Windows 10 1809 或更高版本、Windows Server "
"2019 或更高版本。Windows 运行原生 Windows 版本，无需 WSL2。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:29
msgid "Tools used by the installer"
msgstr "安装程序使用的工具"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:30
msgid ""
"On Linux and macOS: ``curl``, ``gzip`` (``gunzip``), ``tar``, "
"``sha256sum`` or ``shasum``, and ``ssh-keygen`` from OpenSSH 8.1 or "
"later. The signature check uses ``ssh-keygen``. If it is missing, the "
"installer stops and names the package to install; no option skips the "
"signature check. ``tar`` reads the npm packages of :ref:`intro-install-"
"hosts`; without it, those sources are passed over. On Windows: Windows "
"PowerShell 5.1, which Windows includes, and no tool to install."
msgstr ""
"Linux 和 macOS：``curl``、``gzip``\\ （``gunzip``）、``tar``、``sha256sum`` 或 "
"``shasum``，以及 OpenSSH 8.1 或更高版本中的 ``ssh-keygen``。签名检查使用 ``ssh-"
"keygen``。如果缺少该工具，安装程序会停止并指出需要安装的软件包；没有任何选项可以跳过签名检查。``tar`` 用于读取 :ref"
":`intro-install-hosts` 中的 npm 包；缺少该工具时，这些下载源被跳过。Windows：Windows 自带的 "
"Windows PowerShell 5.1，无需安装任何工具。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:38
msgid "Network"
msgstr "网络"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:39
msgid ""
"Outbound HTTPS to the download sources (see :ref:`intro-install-hosts`) "
"and, unless the node is not to join a hub, to the hub. A node needs no "
"inbound connection and no public address."
msgstr ""
"可向下载源（参见 :ref:`intro-install-hosts`）发起出站 HTTPS 连接；节点需要加入 Hub 时，还须能连接该 "
"Hub。节点不需要入站连接，也不需要公网地址。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:46
msgid "Installing with the script"
msgstr "使用脚本安装"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:48
msgid "On Linux and macOS, the installation is one command:"
msgstr "在 Linux 和 macOS 上，安装只需一条命令："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:54
msgid "Without options, the installer carries out these steps:"
msgstr "不带选项时，安装脚本依次执行以下步骤："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:56
msgid ""
"It selects a download source, downloads the release manifest, its "
"signature and the archive of the build, and verifies them (see below)."
msgstr "选择下载源，下载发布清单、其签名以及该版本的压缩包，并对其进行验证（见下文）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:58
msgid ""
"It takes over an earlier release of AgentNetwork or ``anet`` on the "
"machine (see :ref:`intro-install-earlier`)."
msgstr "接管本机上 AgentNetwork 或 ``anet`` 的较早版本（参见 :ref:`intro-install-earlier`）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:60
msgid ""
"It installs the binary as ``~/.local/bin/anet`` and makes the command "
"available (see :ref:`intro-install-path`)."
msgstr "将二进制文件安装为 ``~/.local/bin/anet``，并使该命令可用（参见 :ref:`intro-install-path`）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:62
msgid ""
"It runs ``anet init``, which writes the safe default configuration (see "
":ref:`intro-install-init`)."
msgstr "运行 ``anet init``，写入安全的默认配置（参见 :ref:`intro-install-init`）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:64
msgid ""
"It starts the node with ``anet up`` and waits at most 30 seconds until "
"the node answers. A node that was already running is restarted with the "
"new binary."
msgstr "以 ``anet up`` 启动节点，并等待节点响应，最多 30 秒。已在运行的节点以新的二进制文件重启。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:67
msgid ""
"It joins the public hub ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn`` with ``anet "
"hub-register <hub> --name <host name> --passphrase-later``. The command "
"asks nothing; the recovery passphrase is set afterwards with ``anet "
"identity protect`` (see :ref:`topics-identity-protect`). A node that has "
"already joined a hub keeps that hub unless ``--hub`` names another one."
msgstr ""
"以 ``anet hub-register <hub> --name <主机名> --passphrase-later`` 加入公共 Hub "
"``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``。该命令不进行任何询问；恢复口令之后以 ``anet identity "
"protect`` 设置（参见 :ref:`topics-identity-protect`）。已加入 Hub 的节点保留该 Hub，除非 "
"``--hub`` 指定了另一个 Hub。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:74
msgid ""
"The installer never reads its input, so it runs unchanged in a terminal, "
"in the tool call of a coding agent and in a CI job. The only prompt it "
"can cause is the single password prompt of ``sudo`` described in :ref"
":`intro-install-sudo`, and only in a terminal. The options ``--no-join`` "
"and ``--no-start`` leave out the last steps (see :ref:`intro-install-"
"options`):"
msgstr ""
"安装脚本从不读取其输入，因此在终端、编程 Agent 的工具调用和 CI 作业中均可原样运行。它唯一可能引起的提示是 :ref:`intro-"
"install-sudo` 所述的一次 ``sudo`` 密码提示，且仅在终端中出现。选项 ``--no-join`` 和 ``--no-"
"start`` 省略最后的步骤（参见 :ref:`intro-install-options`）："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:85
msgid ""
"Before anything is written outside a temporary directory, the installer "
"performs these checks. A failure of any check ends the installation and "
"leaves the installed version unchanged."
msgstr "在向临时目录之外写入任何内容之前，安装程序执行以下检查。任何一项检查失败都会终止安装，并保持已安装的版本不变。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:89
msgid "``release.json`` carries a valid signature by the ANet release key."
msgstr "``release.json`` 带有 ANet 发布密钥的有效签名。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:90
msgid "The manifest has not expired."
msgstr "清单未过期。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:91
msgid ""
"The manifest does not name a version older than the ``anet`` already "
"installed at the destination."
msgstr "清单所列版本不低于目标位置已安装的 ``anet``\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:93
msgid ""
"The SHA-256 digest of the downloaded archive, and of the binary inside "
"it, equals the digest in the manifest."
msgstr "所下载归档及其中二进制文件的 SHA-256 摘要，与清单中的摘要一致。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:95
msgid ""
"The new binary reports the version and the module set that the manifest "
"names for its variant. The default variant must not contain the ``shell``"
" module."
msgstr "新二进制文件报告的版本和模块集合，与清单中为其变体所列的一致。默认变体不得包含 ``shell`` 模块。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:99
msgid ""
"The manifest and its signature are stored next to the binary, so that "
"``anet doctor`` can repeat the check later."
msgstr "清单及其签名存放于二进制文件旁，以便 ``anet doctor`` 日后重复该检查。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:105
msgid "Output and log"
msgstr "输出与日志"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:107
msgid ""
"The installer prints one short line for each phase: the download, the "
"takeover of an earlier release and the start of the node. A fresh "
"installation prints:"
msgstr "安装脚本为每个阶段输出一行简短文字：下载、接管较早版本和启动节点。全新安装的输出如下："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:121
msgid ""
"When standard error is a terminal, the first line reads ``Downloading "
"anet 0.3.6 for darwin-arm64 from npmmirror`` and is followed by a "
"progress line with a bar, the megabytes received and expected, the speed "
"and the remaining time. The progress line is redrawn about five times a "
"second and keeps its last state, the total size, the average speed and "
"the time taken, when the download is complete. The bar is red; the "
"variable ``NO_COLOR`` removes the colour, and outside a UTF-8 locale the "
"bar is drawn with ASCII characters. Without a terminal, the single "
"``Downloaded ...`` line takes the place of both."
msgstr ""
"标准错误为终端时，第一行为 ``Downloading anet 0.3.6 for darwin-arm64 from "
"npmmirror``，其后是一行进度，包含进度条、已接收与预期的兆字节数、速度和剩余时间。进度行约每秒刷新五次；下载完成后保留最后状态，即总大小、平均速度和所用时间。进度条为红色；变量"
" ``NO_COLOR`` 取消颜色，非 UTF-8 区域设置下进度条以 ASCII 字符绘制。没有终端时，以单独一行 ``Downloaded "
"...`` 代替这两行。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:131
msgid ""
"The takeover of an earlier release adds a phase line and a line in the "
"summary:"
msgstr "接管较早版本时，增加一行阶段说明，摘要中也增加一行："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:147
msgid "The summary takes these other forms:"
msgstr "摘要还可能采用以下形式："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:153
msgid "Line"
msgstr "输出行"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:154
#: ../../intro/install.rst:1221
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:155
msgid "``Hub   not joined (--no-join)``"
msgstr "``Hub   not joined (--no-join)``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:156
msgid "The node runs and has not joined a hub."
msgstr "节点正在运行，未加入 Hub。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:157
msgid ""
"``Hub   <hub> (awaiting admission; its operator runs: anet-hub admit "
"<AID>)``"
msgstr ""
"``Hub   <hub> (awaiting admission; its operator runs: anet-hub admit "
"<AID>)``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:158
msgid ""
"The hub admits nodes by AID. Send the ``anet-hub admit`` command to the "
"operator of the hub; the node completes the join by itself once the "
"operator has run it."
msgstr "该 Hub 按 AID 准入节点。请将 ``anet-hub admit`` 命令发送给 Hub 运维者；运维者运行该命令后，节点自行完成加入。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:161
msgid "``Hub   <hub>``"
msgstr "``Hub   <hub>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:162
msgid "The node had joined this hub before and keeps it."
msgstr "节点此前已加入该 Hub，并予以保留。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:163
msgid "``Hub   <hub> (registering; it completes on its own)``"
msgstr "``Hub   <hub> (registering; it completes on its own)``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:164
msgid ""
"The hub accepted the request but did not confirm it within the wait of "
"the installer. The node retries by itself; ``anet status`` shows the "
"result."
msgstr "Hub 已接受请求，但未在安装脚本的等待时间内确认。节点会自行重试；``anet status`` 显示结果。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:167
msgid "``Hub   <hub> (not joined)``"
msgstr "``Hub   <hub> (not joined)``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:168
msgid "The join did not complete; a ``Note`` line names the command to repeat it."
msgstr "加入未完成；一行 ``Note`` 给出重新加入的命令。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:170
msgid "``anet 0.3.6 is installed.`` and ``Run 'anet up' to get started.``"
msgstr "``anet 0.3.6 is installed.`` 与 ``Run 'anet up' to get started.``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:171
msgid "The node was not started (``--no-start``)."
msgstr "节点未启动（``--no-start``）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:172
msgid "``Note: <text>``"
msgstr "``Note: <text>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:173
msgid ""
"A step that is left to the user, with the exact command, for example an "
"earlier binary that only the superuser can remove."
msgstr "留给用户执行的步骤，附确切命令，例如只有超级用户才能删除的较早二进制文件。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:176
msgid ""
"The exit status of the installer is 0 when the binary is installed and, "
"unless ``--no-start`` or ``--no-join`` leaves them out, the node runs and"
" the join is complete, pending admission or still registering. It is 3 "
"when the binary is installed but the node did not start or the join "
"failed; the summary then names the command to repeat the step. Any other "
"failure ends the installation with exit status 1 and leaves the installed"
" version unchanged."
msgstr ""
"二进制文件已安装，且（除非 ``--no-start`` 或 ``--no-join`` "
"省略了相应步骤）节点正在运行、加入已完成、等待准入或仍在注册中时，安装脚本的退出状态为 0。二进制文件已安装但节点未能启动或加入失败时，退出状态为"
" 3，摘要给出重复该步骤的命令。其他任何失败都以退出状态 1 结束安装，已安装的版本保持不变。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:183
msgid ""
"``anet`` without arguments prints a short overview: the version, the main"
" commands, the identity, the hub state with the next command, four common"
" commands, and ``anet help --all`` for the complete list."
msgstr ""
"不带参数运行 ``anet`` 时输出简要概览：版本、主要命令、身份、Hub 状态及下一步命令、四个常用命令，以及列出全部命令的 ``anet "
"help --all``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:187
msgid ""
"Everything else is written to the log ``<data "
"directory>/logs/install-<UTC time>.log``: the download sources tried and "
"how fast they answered, each check, each step of a takeover with the "
"section ``Upgraded from anet <version>``, the shell profiles that were "
"changed, and the output of ``anet init`` and of ``anet hub-register``. "
"The data directory is ``ANET_DATA_DIR``, else ``ANET_HOME``, else "
"``~/.anet``. The directory ``logs`` has mode ``0700`` and the log mode "
"``0600``. The last line of the output names the log."
msgstr ""
"其余内容均写入日志 ``<数据目录>/logs/install-<UTC "
"时间>.log``：尝试过的下载源及其响应速度、每项检查、接管的每个步骤（含 ``Upgraded from anet <version>`` "
"一节）、已修改的 shell 配置文件，以及 ``anet init`` 和 ``anet hub-register`` 的输出。数据目录为 "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR``，未设置时为 ``ANET_HOME``，再未设置时为 ``~/.anet``。``logs`` 目录的权限为 "
"``0700``，日志文件为 ``0600``。输出的最后一行给出日志路径。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:196
msgid "When ``ANET_LANG`` begins with ``zh``, the lines are printed in Chinese."
msgstr "``ANET_LANG`` 以 ``zh`` 开头时，各行以中文输出。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:198
msgid ""
"A failure prints the reason and what to do, then whether anything was "
"changed, then the log:"
msgstr "失败时依次输出原因与处理方法、是否已更改任何内容，以及日志："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:207
msgid ""
"When the failure occurs after an earlier release has been taken over, the"
" second line is ``The new binary was not installed. Already done:``, "
"followed by the steps that were carried out."
msgstr ""
"若失败发生在接管较早版本之后，第二行为 ``The new binary was not installed. Already "
"done:``，其后列出已执行的步骤。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:214
msgid "Installer options"
msgstr "安装程序选项"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:216
msgid "Options follow ``sh -s --`` when the script is read from a pipe."
msgstr "从管道读取脚本时，选项跟在 ``sh -s --`` 之后。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:222
msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:223
#: ../../intro/install.rst:982
msgid "Effect"
msgstr "作用"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:224
msgid "``--user``"
msgstr "``--user``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:225
msgid "Install to ``~/.local/bin``. This is the default."
msgstr "安装到 ``~/.local/bin``，为默认值。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:226
msgid "``--system``"
msgstr "``--system``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:227
msgid ""
"Install to ``/usr/local/bin``. ``sudo -n`` is used when required; the "
"installer never asks for a password for this option. When ``sudo`` needs "
"one, the installer stops and says so; run ``sudo -v`` in the same "
"terminal and repeat the command."
msgstr ""
"安装到 ``/usr/local/bin``。需要时使用 ``sudo -n``；使用此选项时安装脚本从不询问密码。``sudo`` "
"需要密码时，安装脚本停止并说明原因；请在同一终端运行 ``sudo -v``，然后重新执行该命令。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:231
msgid "``--prefix DIR``"
msgstr "``--prefix DIR``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:232
msgid "Install to ``DIR``. Overrides ``--user`` and ``--system``."
msgstr "安装到 ``DIR``，优先于 ``--user`` 和 ``--system``\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:233
msgid "``--base URL``"
msgstr "``--base URL``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:234
msgid ""
"Download from ``URL/dl/`` and from no other source (see :ref:`intro-"
"install-hosts`). Only ``https://`` is accepted. The environment variable "
"``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` has the same effect. The checks are the same for "
"every source."
msgstr ""
"仅从 ``URL/dl/`` 下载，不使用其他任何下载源（参见 :ref:`intro-install-hosts`）。仅接受 "
"``https://``。环境变量 ``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` 的作用相同。所有下载源的检查均相同。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:238
msgid "``--shell``"
msgstr "``--shell``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:239
msgid ""
"Install the variant that can run operator-approved commands. This is a "
"different binary, not a setting; see :ref:`intro-install-modules`."
msgstr "安装可运行经运维者批准的命令的变体。这是另一个二进制文件，而不是一项设置，参见 :ref:`intro-install-modules`\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:241
msgid "``--agents[=LIST]``"
msgstr "``--agents[=LIST]``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:242
msgid ""
"After installation, run ``anet agents wire`` for the coding agents found "
"on the machine, or only for the comma-separated ``LIST`` (``claude``, "
"``codex``, ``cursor``, ``opencode``, ``hermes``, ``workbuddy``)."
msgstr ""
"安装完成后，对本机上发现的编程 Agent 运行 ``anet agents wire``，或仅对以逗号分隔的 ``LIST`` "
"运行（``claude``\\ 、\\ ``codex``\\ 、\\ ``cursor``\\ 、\\ ``opencode``\\ 、\\ "
"``hermes``\\ 、\\ ``workbuddy``）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:245
msgid "``--hub URL``"
msgstr "``--hub URL``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:246
msgid ""
"Join the hub at ``URL`` instead of ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``. A"
" node that has joined another hub before joins this one."
msgstr ""
"加入位于 ``URL`` 的 Hub，而非 ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``。此前已加入其他 Hub "
"的节点改为加入此 Hub。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:248
msgid "``--name NAME``"
msgstr "``--name NAME``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:249
msgid "The name to join under. The default is the host name."
msgstr "加入时使用的名称，默认为主机名。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:250
msgid "``--no-join``"
msgstr "``--no-join``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:251
msgid "Start the node, but do not join a hub."
msgstr "启动节点，但不加入 Hub。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:252
msgid "``--no-start``"
msgstr "``--no-start``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:253
msgid "Neither start the node nor join a hub."
msgstr "既不启动节点，也不加入 Hub。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:254
msgid "``--without MODULES``"
msgstr "``--without MODULES``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:255
msgid ""
"Switch off the listed modules in the configuration. See :ref:`intro-"
"install-modules`."
msgstr "在配置中关闭所列模块。参见 :ref:`intro-install-modules`\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:257
msgid "``--no-modify-path``"
msgstr "``--no-modify-path``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:258
msgid ""
"Do not change the shell profiles and do not create the command link. The "
"installer names the line to add instead (see :ref:`intro-install-path`)."
msgstr "不修改 shell 配置文件，也不创建命令链接，改为给出需要加入的那一行（参见 :ref:`intro-install-path`）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:261
msgid "``--help``"
msgstr "``--help``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:262
msgid "Print the option summary."
msgstr "输出选项摘要。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:264
msgid ""
"The options may be combined, for example to join another hub under a "
"chosen name and to connect the local coding agents in one command:"
msgstr "选项可以组合使用，例如以一条命令按指定名称加入另一个 Hub，并连接本地编程 Agent："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:272
msgid ""
"On a hub that admits by AID, the summary names the ``anet-hub admit`` "
"command that the hub operator runs; the join then completes without "
"further input. See :doc:`tutorial` for the full sequence."
msgstr ""
"在按 AID 准入的 Hub 上，摘要给出 Hub 运维者需要运行的 ``anet-hub admit`` "
"命令，此后加入无需进一步输入即可完成。完整流程参见 :doc:`tutorial`。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:276
msgid ""
"Hubs no longer use invitation codes. The installer rejects the former "
"options ``--token`` and ``--token-file`` and says so."
msgstr "Hub 不再使用邀请码。安装程序会拒绝原有的 ``--token`` 与 ``--token-file`` 选项，并予以说明。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:282
#: ../../intro/install.rst:732
msgid "Download sources"
msgstr "下载源"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:284
msgid ""
"The installer asks two sources at the same time, each with a limit of "
"three seconds, and tries those that answer, the fastest first. A source "
"that does not answer within the limit is not used. Then it tries the "
"remaining sources in order:"
msgstr "安装脚本同时询问两个下载源，各自时限为 3 秒，并按响应速度从快到慢尝试作出响应的下载源。在时限内未响应的下载源不予使用。随后按顺序尝试其余下载源："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:293
msgid "Source"
msgstr "下载源"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:294
#: ../../intro/install.rst:1031
msgid "Location"
msgstr "位置"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:295
msgid "``npmmirror``"
msgstr "``npmmirror``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:296
msgid ""
"``https://registry.npmmirror.com``: the npm package of the build, "
"downloaded as the tarball of the registry. Asked first, together with "
"GitHub."
msgstr ""
"``https://registry.npmmirror.com``：该版本的 npm 包，以注册表的 tarball 下载。与 GitHub "
"一同最先询问。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:299
msgid "``GitHub``"
msgstr "``GitHub``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:300
msgid ""
"``https://github.com/ANetResearch/ANet/releases/latest/download/<file>``."
" Asked first, together with npmmirror."
msgstr ""
"``https://github.com/ANetResearch/ANet/releases/latest/download/<file>``。与"
" npmmirror 一同最先询问。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:302
msgid "``npmjs``"
msgstr "``npmjs``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:303
msgid "``https://registry.npmjs.org``: the same tarball."
msgstr "``https://registry.npmjs.org``：同一 tarball。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:304
msgid "``jsDelivr``"
msgstr "``jsDelivr``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:305
msgid "``https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/<package>@latest/dl/<file>``."
msgstr "``https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/<package>@latest/dl/<file>``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:306
msgid "``agentnetwork.org.cn``, ``hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``"
msgstr "``agentnetwork.org.cn``、``hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:307
msgid ""
"The project hosts: ``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/dl/<file>`` and "
"``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn/dl/<file>``."
msgstr ""
"项目主机：``https://agentnetwork.org.cn/dl/<file>`` 和 "
"``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn/dl/<file>``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:310
msgid ""
"The npm package of the build is ``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>`` "
"(``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-<os>-<cpu>`` with ``--shell``), where "
"``<os>`` is ``linux`` or ``darwin`` and ``<cpu>`` is ``x64`` or "
"``arm64``. Its directory ``package/dl/`` holds ``release.json``, "
"``release.json.sig`` and the archive of the build, exactly as the project"
" hosts serve them under ``/dl/``. The installer reads the version from "
"``<registry>/<package>/latest``, builds the address of the tarball from "
"it, and extracts only these three files, each of which must be a regular "
"file of bounded size."
msgstr ""
"该版本的 npm 包为 ``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>``\\ （使用 ``--shell`` 时为 "
"``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-<os>-<cpu>``），其中 ``<os>`` 为 ``linux`` 或 "
"``darwin``，``<cpu>`` 为 ``x64`` 或 ``arm64``。其 ``package/dl/`` 目录包含 "
"``release.json``、``release.json.sig`` 以及该版本的压缩包，与项目主机在 ``/dl/`` "
"下提供的文件完全相同。安装脚本从 ``<registry>/<package>/latest`` 读取版本，据此构造 tarball "
"的地址，并仅解压这三个文件，每个文件都必须是大小有界的普通文件。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:319
msgid ""
"The source decides how fast and whether the files arrive, not what is "
"accepted:"
msgstr "下载源决定文件到达的速度以及能否到达，而不决定接受哪些文件："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:322
msgid ""
"The signed manifest and the SHA-256 digests decide, by the checks of :ref"
":`intro-install-script`, for every source alike."
msgstr "由已签名的清单和 SHA-256 摘要按 :ref:`intro-install-script` 中的检查作出决定，对所有下载源一视同仁。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:324
msgid ""
"A source that does not serve a release is passed over: an HTTP error, a "
"time-out, an HTML page where a manifest is expected, a missing file, a "
"redirect to a host that the source does not use, or a malformed tarball."
msgstr ""
"未提供发布的下载源被跳过：HTTP 错误、超时、应为清单之处返回 HTML 页面、文件缺失、重定向至该下载源不使用的主机，或 tarball "
"格式错误。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:327
msgid ""
"A source that serves a release that fails a check ends the installation. "
"The installer does not move on to another source."
msgstr "所提供的发布未通过检查的下载源使安装终止。安装脚本不会转而尝试其他下载源。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:329
msgid ""
"A source whose release is older than the installer itself, or than the "
"``anet`` already installed, is a mirror that lags behind. It is passed "
"over while another source serves the current release."
msgstr "所提供的发布早于安装脚本自身或已安装的 ``anet`` 的下载源，视为滞后的镜像。只要另有下载源提供当前发布，即跳过该下载源。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:333
msgid ""
"The installer follows redirects itself, at most five, over ``https://`` "
"only, and only to the hosts of that source: ``registry.npmmirror.com`` "
"and ``cdn.npmmirror.com`` for npmmirror, ``github.com`` and "
"``*.githubusercontent.com`` for GitHub, and the host of the source for "
"the others. ``--base URL`` and ``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` replace every "
"source; the files are then read from ``URL/dl/``, and redirects may lead "
"to any ``https://`` host. ``anet update`` uses the same sources in the "
"same order (see :ref:`intro-install-update`)."
msgstr ""
"安装脚本自行跟随重定向，最多五次，仅限 ``https://``，且仅限该下载源的主机：npmmirror 为 "
"``registry.npmmirror.com`` 和 ``cdn.npmmirror.com``，GitHub 为 "
"``github.com`` 和 ``*.githubusercontent.com``，其他下载源为其自身的主机。``--base URL`` "
"和 ``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` 取代全部下载源；此时从 ``URL/dl/`` 读取文件，重定向可指向任何 "
"``https://`` 主机。``anet update`` 使用相同的下载源和相同的顺序（参见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"update`）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:345
#: ../../intro/install.rst:865
msgid "Earlier installations"
msgstr "较早的安装"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:347
msgid ""
"The installer replaces earlier releases without asking for input. It "
"examines every ``anet`` on the search path, the ``anet`` in the global "
"``bin`` directory of npm, and ``/usr/local/bin/anet``, "
"``/opt/homebrew/bin/anet`` and ``~/.local/bin/anet``, and acts on each "
"one as follows."
msgstr ""
"安装脚本替换早期版本，不要求任何输入。它检查搜索路径中的每一个 ``anet``、npm 全局 ``bin`` 目录中的 ``anet``，以及 "
"``/usr/local/bin/anet``、``/opt/homebrew/bin/anet`` 和 "
"``~/.local/bin/anet``，并按下表处理。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:356
msgid "Found"
msgstr "检查结果"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:357
msgid "Action"
msgstr "处理方式"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:358
msgid ""
"AgentNetwork 1.x installed with npm (the package ``@agentnetwork/anet`` "
"1.x)"
msgstr "通过 npm 安装的 AgentNetwork 1.x（npm 包 ``@agentnetwork/anet`` 1.x）"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:360
msgid ""
"The daemon is stopped with the ``anet stop`` command of that release. The"
" package is removed with ``npm uninstall -g @agentnetwork/anet`` under "
"the npm prefix in which it is installed."
msgstr ""
"用该版本自身的 ``anet stop`` 命令停止守护进程，并在其所在的 npm 前缀下用 ``npm uninstall -g "
"@agentnetwork/anet`` 删除该包。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:363
msgid ""
"AgentNetwork 1.x, anet 0.1 or anet 0.2 as a binary, for example from "
"``https://clawnet.cc/install.sh`` or from an earlier ``install.sh``"
msgstr ""
"以二进制文件形式安装的 AgentNetwork 1.x、anet 0.1 或 anet 0.2，例如来自 "
"``https://clawnet.cc/install.sh`` 或早期的 ``install.sh``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:365
msgid ""
"The daemon is stopped with ``anet stop`` (1.x) or ``anet stop --all`` "
"(0.1 and 0.2). In a directory that the user can write, the binary is "
"replaced by a symbolic link to the new binary, so that scripts and "
"configurations that name the old path run the new release. In a directory"
" that only the superuser can write, the binary is removed."
msgstr ""
"用 ``anet stop``\\ （1.x）或 ``anet stop --all``\\ （0.1 和 "
"0.2）停止守护进程。在用户可写的目录中，该二进制文件被替换为指向新二进制文件的符号链接，使引用旧路径的脚本和配置运行新版本。在只有超级用户可写的目录中，该二进制文件被删除。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:370
msgid "``anet`` 0.3 or later, and the npm launcher of 0.3 or later"
msgstr "``anet`` 0.3 或更高版本，以及 0.3 或更高版本的 npm 启动器"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:371
msgid ""
"Left in place and named in the log. The installation directory is placed "
"before it on the search path. An npm launcher whose command is the "
"installation target itself is removed with npm."
msgstr "保留原处，并在日志中列出。安装目录在搜索路径中被放在它之前。若 npm 启动器的命令恰好就是安装目标本身，则用 npm 将其删除。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:374
msgid "A file named ``anet`` that is not a program of AgentNetwork"
msgstr "名为 ``anet`` 但不是 AgentNetwork 程序的文件"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:375
msgid ""
"Not run, not changed, and named in the log. At the installation target "
"itself (``~/.local/bin/anet`` by default), such a file is refused before "
"anything is changed; a link to a file that no longer exists is replaced."
msgstr ""
"不运行、不更改，并在日志中列出。若此类文件位于安装目标本身（默认为 "
"``~/.local/bin/anet``），则安装在更改任何内容之前被拒绝；指向已不存在文件的链接会被替换。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:380
msgid ""
"An earlier release is recognized by the Go module path in its binary, or "
"by the ``repository`` field of its npm package. Its version is read with "
"``anet version`` in an empty home directory and with a time limit. Apart "
"from that, only its ``stop`` command is run."
msgstr ""
"早期版本依据其二进制文件中的 Go 模块路径，或其 npm 包的 ``repository`` 字段识别。其版本号通过 ``anet "
"version`` 读取，运行时使用空的主目录并设有时限。除此之外，只运行其 ``stop`` 命令。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:385
msgid ""
"On Linux, a systemd unit named ``anet-daemon`` whose ``ExecStart`` runs a"
" binary of AgentNetwork 1.x is disabled and stopped before the daemon, "
"since the unit restarts the daemon (``Restart=always``). This is the unit"
" that AgentNetwork 1.x prints for its users to install; the npm packages "
"of 1.x register no service and no launchd agent themselves. A user unit "
"is disabled with ``systemctl --user disable --now anet-daemon``, a system"
" unit with ``sudo -n systemctl disable --now anet-daemon`` (see :ref"
":`intro-install-sudo`). The unit files are not deleted. When a system "
"unit cannot be disabled, a ``Note`` line gives the command."
msgstr ""
"在 Linux 上，名为 ``anet-daemon``、其 ``ExecStart`` 运行 AgentNetwork 1.x 二进制文件的 "
"systemd 单元，会在停止守护进程之前被停用并停止，因为该单元会重新启动守护进程（``Restart=always``）。这是 "
"AgentNetwork 1.x 提示其用户安装的单元；1.x 的 npm 包本身不注册任何服务或 launchd 代理。用户单元以 "
"``systemctl --user disable --now anet-daemon`` 停用，系统单元以 ``sudo -n "
"systemctl disable --now anet-daemon`` 停用（参见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"sudo`）。单元文件不被删除。系统单元无法停用时，一行 ``Note`` 给出相应命令。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:395
msgid ""
"The data directory of an earlier release is renamed and never deleted. "
"The directory concerned is the one that the new release uses: "
"``ANET_DATA_DIR``, else ``ANET_HOME``, else ``~/.anet``."
msgstr ""
"早期版本的数据目录只会被改名，绝不删除。所涉及的目录是新版本使用的目录：``ANET_DATA_DIR``，否则为 "
"``ANET_HOME``，否则为 ``~/.anet``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:399
msgid ""
"A directory with the identity file of anet 0.1 or 0.2, or with the files "
"of AgentNetwork 1.x and no identity of 0.3, is renamed to "
"``<directory>-legacy-<version>-<time>``, for example ``~/.anet-"
"legacy-1.1.15-20261020T120000Z``. The time is UTC. The files that ``anet "
"init`` of 0.3 may have written into it hold no identity and move with it."
" ``anet init`` then writes a new configuration, and the first ``anet up``"
" creates a new identity."
msgstr ""
"含有 anet 0.1 或 0.2 身份文件的目录，或含有 AgentNetwork 1.x 文件而没有 0.3 身份的目录，被改名为 "
"``<目录>-legacy-<版本>-<时间>``，例如 ``~/.anet-"
"legacy-1.1.15-20261020T120000Z``，时间为 UTC。0.3 的 ``anet init`` "
"可能已写入其中的文件不含身份，随目录一起移走。随后 ``anet init`` 写入新的配置，第一次 ``anet up`` 创建新的身份。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:406
msgid ""
"A directory with the files of AgentNetwork 1.x and an identity of 0.3 "
"(``identity.kel``, or ``ids/<name>/identity.kel``) stays in place. Only "
"the 1.x files are moved into the new directory."
msgstr ""
"同时含有 AgentNetwork 1.x 文件和 0.3 身份（``identity.kel`` 或 "
"``ids/<name>/identity.kel``）的目录保留原处，只有 1.x 的文件被移入新目录。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:409
msgid "A directory of 0.3, or of a newer release, is not changed."
msgstr "0.3 或更新版本的目录不作任何修改。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:411
msgid ""
"The daemon applies the same rule. It does not start in a data directory "
"of an earlier release and reports ``identity_v02``."
msgstr "守护进程采用同一规则。它不在较早版本的数据目录中启动，并报告 ``identity_v02``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:414
msgid ""
"A daemon of AgentNetwork 1.x can still hold the data directory after the "
"``stop`` commands above, for example when its binary was deleted by hand "
"or when an MCP client started it. The installer then stops it itself:"
msgstr ""
"执行上述 ``stop`` 命令之后，AgentNetwork 1.x 的守护进程仍可能占用数据目录，例如其二进制文件已被手动删除，或该守护进程由"
" MCP 客户端启动。此时安装脚本自行停止它："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:418
msgid ""
"through the shutdown interface of 1.x on ``127.0.0.1:3998``, with the API"
" token from the data directory. The token is passed to ``curl`` in a "
"private configuration file, never on a command line;"
msgstr ""
"通过 1.x 在 ``127.0.0.1:3998`` 上的关闭接口，使用数据目录中的 API 令牌。该令牌通过私有配置文件传递给 "
"``curl``，从不出现在命令行中；"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:421
msgid ""
"if the daemon still runs, with ``SIGTERM`` to the process named in "
"``daemon.pid``, and only after the executable of that process has been "
"identified as AgentNetwork 1.x."
msgstr ""
"若守护进程仍在运行，则向 ``daemon.pid`` 所指进程发送 ``SIGTERM``，且仅在根据该进程的可执行文件确认其为 "
"AgentNetwork 1.x 之后发送。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:425
msgid ""
"Each step is followed by a wait of at most 10 seconds. A daemon of this "
"release that runs on the identity of 0.3 in the same directory is never "
"taken for an earlier release and never signalled. Only when a daemon of "
"1.x cannot be stopped, or a daemon of anet 0.2 still answers on its "
"control address, does the directory stay in place; ``anet init`` and the "
"start of the node are then skipped, and a ``Note`` line says what to stop"
" before the installer is run again."
msgstr ""
"每一步之后最多等待 10 秒。本版本以同一目录中的 0.3 身份运行的守护进程绝不会被当作较早版本，也绝不会收到信号。仅当 1.x "
"守护进程无法停止，或 anet 0.2 守护进程仍在其控制地址上响应时，该目录才保留原处；此时跳过 ``anet init`` "
"和节点启动，并以一行 ``Note`` 说明在重新运行安装脚本之前需要停止什么。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:433
msgid ""
"The output names the takeover in the phase line ``Replacing <release>`` "
"and in the summary line ``Replaced <release>; its data is kept in "
"<directory>``. The log lists every step in the section ``Upgraded from "
"anet <version>``:"
msgstr ""
"输出以阶段行 ``Replacing <release>`` 和摘要行 ``Replaced <release>; its data is "
"kept in <directory>`` 指明接管。日志在 ``Upgraded from anet <version>`` 一节中列出每一步："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:450
msgid ""
"The renamed directory keeps the identity and the API tokens of the "
"earlier release. Release 0.3 does not read them. See :doc:`/upgrading` "
"for the steps after the installation."
msgstr "改名后的目录保存早期版本的身份和 API 令牌，0.3 版不读取它们。安装后的步骤参见 :doc:`/upgrading`。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:457
msgid "Administrator rights"
msgstr "管理员权限"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:459
msgid "A per-user installation needs administrator rights only in these cases:"
msgstr "按用户安装仅在以下情形需要管理员权限："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:461
msgid ""
"an earlier release sits where only the superuser can remove it, for "
"example ``/usr/local/bin/anet`` owned by ``root``, or a 1.x npm package "
"under a prefix owned by ``root``;"
msgstr ""
"较早版本位于只有超级用户才能删除的位置，例如属于 ``root`` 的 ``/usr/local/bin/anet``，或位于属于 "
"``root`` 的前缀下的 1.x npm 包；"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:464
msgid "a system unit of AgentNetwork 1.x is to be disabled;"
msgstr "需要停用 AgentNetwork 1.x 的系统单元；"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:465
msgid ""
"the command link of :ref:`intro-install-path` is to be created in a "
"directory owned by ``root``."
msgstr "需要在属于 ``root`` 的目录中创建 :ref:`intro-install-path` 所述的命令链接。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:468
msgid ""
"In these cases, and only when a terminal is available, the installer "
"prints one line with the reason, for example:"
msgstr "在这些情形下，且仅在有终端可用时，安装脚本输出一行说明原因，例如："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:475
msgid ""
"It then runs ``sudo -v`` once. ``sudo`` reads the password from the "
"terminal, never from the input of the script. The steps that need the "
"superuser then run with ``sudo -n`` within that session. When ``sudo`` is"
" declined or fails, the installation continues, and the summary has one "
"``Note`` line with the command for each step that was not carried out. "
"When ``sudo -n`` already succeeds, no password is asked."
msgstr ""
"随后运行一次 ``sudo -v``。``sudo`` 从终端读取密码，从不从脚本的输入读取。此后需要超级用户权限的步骤在该会话内以 ``sudo"
" -n`` 运行。``sudo`` 被拒绝或失败时，安装继续进行，摘要中为每个未执行的步骤给出一行附命令的 ``Note``。若 ``sudo "
"-n`` 已可成功执行，则不询问密码。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:482
msgid ""
"Without a terminal, as in the tool call of a coding agent or a CI job, "
"nothing is asked: ``sudo`` is used only as ``sudo -n``, and the ``Note`` "
"lines remain. ``--system`` keeps its behaviour and uses ``sudo -n`` only."
msgstr ""
"没有终端时（例如编程 Agent 的工具调用或 CI 作业），不进行任何询问：``sudo`` 只以 ``sudo -n`` "
"的形式使用，``Note`` 行照常给出。``--system`` 保持原有行为，只使用 ``sudo -n``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:489
msgid "Search path"
msgstr "搜索路径"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:491
msgid ""
"The binary stays in ``~/.local/bin``, where the user can replace it; "
"``anet update`` therefore needs no administrator rights."
msgstr "二进制文件保留在用户可替换的 ``~/.local/bin`` 中，因此 ``anet update`` 无需管理员权限。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:494
msgid ""
"When ``~/.local/bin`` is not on the search path of the shell that runs "
"the installer and a terminal is available, the installer creates a "
"command link ``anet`` pointing to ``~/.local/bin/anet``, so that ``anet``"
" runs in that terminal at once. The link goes into the first of "
"``~/bin``, ``/opt/homebrew/bin`` and ``/usr/local/bin`` that is on the "
"search path and writable by the user; no password is needed. When none of"
" them is, and ``/usr/local/bin`` is on the search path, the link "
"``/usr/local/bin/anet`` is created with ``sudo`` within the single "
"session of :ref:`intro-install-sudo`. An earlier release at the place of "
"the link is replaced by it; another file there is left unchanged, and no "
"link is created. The last line of the output then reads ``Run 'anet' to "
"get started.``. When ``~/.local/bin`` is already on the search path, no "
"link is created and nothing is asked."
msgstr ""
"当 ``~/.local/bin`` 不在运行安装脚本的 shell 的搜索路径中且有终端可用时，安装脚本创建指向 "
"``~/.local/bin/anet`` 的命令链接 ``anet``，使 ``anet`` 在该终端中立即可用。链接放在 "
"``~/bin``、``/opt/homebrew/bin`` 和 ``/usr/local/bin`` "
"中第一个位于搜索路径且当前用户可写的目录，无需密码。若这些目录均不满足，且 ``/usr/local/bin`` 在搜索路径中，则在 :ref"
":`intro-install-sudo` 所述的单次会话内以 ``sudo`` 创建链接 "
"``/usr/local/bin/anet``。链接位置上的较早版本被该链接替换；该位置的其他文件保持不变，且不创建链接。此时输出的最后一行为 "
"``Run 'anet' to get started.``。若 ``~/.local/bin`` "
"已在搜索路径中，则不创建链接，也不进行任何询问。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:507
msgid ""
"Without a terminal, no link is created. The last line then says to run "
"``anet`` in a new terminal, or in the current one after this command:"
msgstr "没有终端时不创建链接。此时最后一行提示在新终端中运行 ``anet``，或在当前终端中先执行以下命令："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:514
msgid ""
"For new terminals, when the installation directory is not on the search "
"path, when another ``anet`` comes before it, or when a new login shell "
"does not find the new binary, the installer appends this block to the "
"shell profiles, or replaces the block if it is already present:"
msgstr ""
"对于新打开的终端，当安装目录不在搜索路径中、搜索路径中另有 ``anet`` 位于其前，或新的登录 shell "
"找不到新的二进制文件时，安装脚本将下面这段内容追加到 shell 配置文件中；该段已存在时则替换它："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:531
msgid "Shell"
msgstr "Shell"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:532
msgid "Profiles"
msgstr "配置文件"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:533
msgid "zsh"
msgstr "zsh"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:534
msgid ""
"``.zprofile`` and ``.zshrc`` in ``$ZDOTDIR``, or in the home directory "
"when ``ZDOTDIR`` is not set"
msgstr "``$ZDOTDIR`` 中的 ``.zprofile`` 和 ``.zshrc``；未设置 ``ZDOTDIR`` 时为主目录中的这两个文件"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:536
msgid "bash"
msgstr "bash"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:537
msgid ""
"``~/.bash_profile`` if it exists, else ``~/.bash_login`` if it exists, "
"else ``~/.profile``; and ``~/.bashrc``"
msgstr ""
"``~/.bash_profile``\\ （若存在），否则 ``~/.bash_login``\\ （若存在），否则 "
"``~/.profile``；以及 ``~/.bashrc``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:539
msgid "fish"
msgstr "fish"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:540
msgid ""
"``~/.config/fish/conf.d/anet.fish`` (below ``XDG_CONFIG_HOME`` when it is"
" set), with the same effect in fish syntax"
msgstr ""
"``~/.config/fish/conf.d/anet.fish``\\ （设置了 ``XDG_CONFIG_HOME`` 时位于其下），以 "
"fish 语法实现相同效果"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:542
msgid "Other shells"
msgstr "其他 shell"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:543
msgid "``~/.profile``"
msgstr "``~/.profile``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:545
msgid ""
"The profiles of the login shell named by ``SHELL`` are created when they "
"do not exist. The profiles of other shells are changed only when they "
"exist. Running the installer again adds no second block; a block that is "
"no longer last in its file is moved to the end. A profile that is a "
"symbolic link, for example into a repository of dotfiles, is written "
"through the link. A file with a block whose end marker is missing is not "
"changed, and a ``Note`` line names it. The log lists the profiles that "
"were changed."
msgstr ""
"``SHELL`` 所指登录 shell 的配置文件不存在时会被创建；其他 shell "
"的配置文件只在已存在时修改。再次运行安装脚本不会加入第二段；已不在文件末尾的该段会被移到末尾。作为符号链接的配置文件（例如指向 dotfiles "
"仓库）通过链接写入。某段缺少结束标记的文件不作修改，并以一行 ``Note`` 指明。日志列出已修改的配置文件。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:553
msgid ""
"The installer then starts a login, interactive shell of ``SHELL`` with an"
" empty environment and input from ``/dev/null``, asks it for ``command -v"
" anet``, and writes the result to the log:"
msgstr ""
"随后，安装脚本以空环境、从 ``/dev/null`` 读取输入的方式启动 ``SHELL`` 的登录交互式 shell，执行 ``command"
" -v anet``，并将结果写入日志："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:561
msgid ""
"When a new terminal would still run another ``anet``, a ``Note`` line of "
"the summary says so."
msgstr "若新终端仍会运行另一个 ``anet``，摘要中以一行 ``Note`` 说明。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:564
msgid ""
"With ``--no-modify-path``, neither the profiles nor the command link are "
"changed, and the last line of the output names the directory to put on "
"the search path. When the installer runs as the superuser, it does not "
"change profiles. To undo the change, delete the lines between the two "
"markers, and remove the command link ``anet`` if it was created; the log "
"names its place."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``--no-modify-path`` "
"时，既不修改配置文件，也不创建命令链接，输出的最后一行给出需要加入搜索路径的目录。以超级用户身份运行时，安装脚本不修改配置文件。要撤销修改，删除两个标记之间的各行；若已创建命令链接"
" ``anet``，将其删除，其位置记录在日志中。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:573
#: ../../intro/install.rst:932
msgid "Verifying the installer before running it"
msgstr "运行前验证安装程序"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:575
msgid ""
"``curl ... | sh`` trusts the host that serves the script and that host's "
"TLS certificate. The signature checks above protect the binary, not the "
"script itself. To avoid trusting the host, download the script and its "
"signature, and verify both with the published release key before running "
"the script."
msgstr ""
"``curl ... | sh`` 信任提供该脚本的主机及其 TLS "
"证书。上述签名检查保护的是二进制文件，而不是脚本本身。若不愿信任该主机，请下载脚本及其签名，并在运行脚本之前用公布的发布密钥验证二者。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:581
msgid ""
"The release key belongs to the project maintainers. It signs binaries, "
"the installer and the manifest of release artifacts. It is not an "
"identity key of any node. The key and its fingerprint are also published "
"in ``SECURITY.md`` and ``README.md`` of the ANet repository; compare them"
" with the values below, and use the repository copy if they differ."
msgstr ""
"发布密钥属于项目维护者，用于签署二进制文件、安装程序和发布产物的清单，不是任何节点的身份密钥。密钥及其指纹也公布于 ANet 仓库的 "
"``SECURITY.md`` 和 ``README.md`` 中；请与下列值比对，二者不一致时以仓库中的副本为准。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:594
msgid ""
"The key fingerprint is "
"``SHA256:/4FMm/jgZcBII3z3O3r81Y8SxFfugdLRu3zj2gnclD4``. A successful "
"check prints ``Good \"anet-release@agentnetwork.org.cn\" signature`` "
"followed by the fingerprint."
msgstr ""
"密钥指纹为 ``SHA256:/4FMm/jgZcBII3z3O3r81Y8SxFfugdLRu3zj2gnclD4``\\ 。检查成功时会输出 "
"``Good \"anet-release@agentnetwork.org.cn\" signature``，后接指纹。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:601
msgid "Installing on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上安装"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:603
msgid ""
"The Windows build runs natively on Windows 10 version 1809 or later and "
"on Windows Server 2019 or later, on amd64 and arm64. WSL2 is not "
"required."
msgstr ""
"Windows 版本在 Windows 10 1809 或更高版本以及 Windows Server 2019 或更高版本上原生运行，支持 "
"amd64 与 arm64，无需 WSL2。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:609
msgid ""
"Windows PowerShell 5.1, which every supported version of Windows "
"includes. The installer uses no tool that has to be installed; in "
"particular it does not use ``ssh-keygen``, because Windows 10 version "
"1809 ships an OpenSSH release older than 8.1."
msgstr ""
"Windows PowerShell 5.1，所有受支持的 Windows 版本均自带该组件。安装程序不使用任何需要另行安装的工具，尤其不使用 "
"``ssh-keygen``，因为 Windows 10 1809 自带的 OpenSSH 版本低于 8.1。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:613
msgid ""
"Outbound HTTPS to at least one of the download sources (see :ref:`intro-"
"install-windows-sources`)."
msgstr "可通过出站 HTTPS 访问至少一个下载源（参见 :ref:`intro-install-windows-sources`）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:616
msgid ""
"The installer runs in a window that is elevated or not, and in a session "
"without a visible console, such as the tool call of an agent or a CI job."
msgstr "安装程序可在提升权限或未提升权限的窗口中运行，也可在没有可见控制台的会话中运行，例如代理的工具调用或 CI 作业。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:620
msgid "Installing with the one-line command"
msgstr "使用单行命令安装"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:622
msgid ""
"The installation is started with one line. The line is identical in "
"``cmd.exe``, Windows PowerShell 5.1, PowerShell 7, a ``bash`` or ``zsh`` "
"shell in WSL 1 or WSL 2, and Git Bash: it contains no character that one "
"of these shells interprets, and everything after ``-Command`` is one "
"argument in double quotes. Replace ``CONTROLLER_AID`` with the AID of the"
" node that is to be given access to the shell module of this computer. "
"The installer installs the build with the ``shell`` module, gives that "
"AID access to it, starts the node, registers it with "
"``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn`` and starts it at every logon:"
msgstr ""
"安装只需一行命令。该命令在 ``cmd.exe``、Windows PowerShell 5.1、PowerShell 7、WSL 1 或 WSL"
" 2 中的 ``bash`` 或 ``zsh`` 以及 Git Bash 中完全相同：其中不含上述任何 shell "
"会解释的字符，``-Command`` 之后的全部内容是一个用双引号括起的参数。请将 ``CONTROLLER_AID`` 替换为将获得本机 "
"shell 模块访问权限的节点的 AID。安装程序安装含 ``shell`` 模块的版本，向该 AID 授予访问权限，启动节点，将其注册到 "
"``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``，并设置为每次登录时启动："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:636
msgid ""
"Without ``-Controller``, the line installs the default build and gives no"
" agent access. The node is started and registered with the hub in the "
"same way; ``-NoJoin`` leaves out the registration and ``-NoStart`` leaves"
" out both. Everything else described in this section, the download "
"sources, the choice of the install directory, the takeover of earlier "
"installations, the ``PATH`` and the output, is the same in both forms:"
msgstr ""
"不带 ``-Controller`` 时，该命令安装默认版本，不向任何代理授予访问权限。节点同样会启动并注册到 hub；``-NoJoin`` "
"省略注册，``-NoStart`` 省略启动与注册。本节所述的其他内容，包括下载源、安装目录的选择、对较早安装的接管、``PATH`` "
"以及输出，在两种形式下均相同："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:647
msgid ""
"The line starts a new ``powershell.exe``, which enables TLS 1.2 (required"
" by Windows PowerShell 5.1), downloads ``install.ps1`` and runs it as a "
"script block, to which the execution policy does not apply. The "
"placeholder is a plain word because ``cmd.exe`` reads ``<`` and ``>`` as "
"redirections; the installer refuses the unchanged placeholder "
"``CONTROLLER_AID`` with a message that names it. The exit status of "
"``powershell.exe`` is the result of the installation: 0 when it "
"completed; 3 when ANet is installed but the installation stopped before "
"its last step and the commands that complete it were printed (see :ref"
":`intro-install-windows-elevated` and :ref:`intro-install-windows-"
"earlier`); 1 for a refusal or a failure before anything was installed; "
"otherwise the exit status of the ``anet`` command that failed."
msgstr ""
"该命令启动一个新的 ``powershell.exe``，后者启用 TLS 1.2（Windows PowerShell 5.1 需要），下载 "
"``install.ps1`` 并将其作为脚本块运行，执行策略不适用于脚本块。由于 ``cmd.exe`` 将 ``<`` 与 ``>`` "
"解释为重定向，占位符采用普通单词；安装程序拒绝未替换的占位符 "
"``CONTROLLER_AID``，并在消息中指明该占位符。``powershell.exe`` 的退出状态即为安装结果：安装完成时为 "
"0；ANet 已安装但安装在最后一步之前停止、且已输出完成安装所需命令时为 3（参见 :ref:`intro-install-windows-"
"elevated` 与 :ref:`intro-install-windows-earlier`）；在安装任何内容之前被拒绝或失败时为 "
"1；其他情况为失败的 ``anet`` 命令的退出状态。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:661
msgid "No interaction"
msgstr "无交互"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:663
msgid ""
"The installer asks no question and reads nothing from the console. Every "
"decision is made from the parameters on the command line. In particular:"
msgstr "安装程序不提出任何问题，也不从控制台读取任何内容。所有决定均依据命令行中的参数作出。具体而言："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:666
msgid ""
"``-Controller`` on the command line is the consent to the grant. The "
"installer passes it to ``anet init --shell-controller`` as ``--yes``, and"
" no confirmation is asked. The summary names the agent that was given "
"access and the command that revokes it; the log records what was granted,"
" read back from ``config.json`` and ``peers.allow``, and both steps of "
"the revocation."
msgstr ""
"命令行中的 ``-Controller`` 即为对授权的同意。安装程序将其以 ``--yes`` 传给 ``anet init --shell-"
"controller``，不请求任何确认。摘要注明获得访问权限的代理及撤销该权限的命令；日志记录从 ``config.json`` 与 "
"``peers.allow`` 读回的已授予权限，以及撤销权限的两个步骤。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:671
msgid ""
"The recovery passphrase is not asked during the installation: the "
"installer always runs ``anet hub-register`` with ``--passphrase-later``. "
"Set the passphrase afterwards with ``anet identity protect``."
msgstr ""
"安装过程中不询问恢复口令：安装程序始终以 ``--passphrase-later`` 运行 ``anet hub-"
"register``。请在安装后使用 ``anet identity protect`` 设置口令。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:674
msgid ""
"The installation also completes when standard input and output are not a "
"console, as with WSL interoperability, a CI job or the tool call of an "
"agent."
msgstr "标准输入与标准输出不是控制台时（例如 WSL 互操作、CI 作业或代理的工具调用），安装同样可以完成。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:681
msgid "What the installer prints"
msgstr "安装程序的输出"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:683
msgid ""
"While it works, the installer prints one line per phase: the download, "
"and the installed binary with the result of the signature check. On an "
"interactive console, the download is shown as one line that is updated "
"several times per second, with a bar, the megabytes received and "
"expected, the current speed and the estimated time remaining; when the "
"download completes, the line remains with the size, the average speed and"
" the elapsed time. The bar is drawn in red and dark gray, or without "
"colours when the variable ``NO_COLOR`` is set, and with ASCII characters "
"when the code page of the console cannot display the line-drawing "
"character. When the output is not an interactive console, as in a CI job,"
" the tool call of an agent or a pipe, the download is reported in one "
"line once it is complete."
msgstr ""
"安装过程中，安装程序每个阶段输出一行：下载，以及已安装的二进制文件和签名检查结果。在交互式控制台中，下载显示为每秒更新数次的一行，包含进度条、已接收与预期的兆字节数、当前速度和预计剩余时间；下载完成后，该行保留，显示大小、平均速度和所用时间。进度条以红色和深灰色绘制；设置变量"
" ``NO_COLOR`` 时不使用颜色；控制台代码页无法显示制表符时改用 ASCII 字符。输出不是交互式控制台时（例如 CI "
"作业、代理的工具调用或管道），下载完成后以一行报告。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:695
msgid "The installation ends with a short summary, for example:"
msgstr "安装以简短的摘要结束，例如："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:706
msgid ""
"The ``AID`` line gives the identity of the node in full. The ``Hub`` line"
" states whether the node joined the hub, whether the hub waits for its "
"operator to admit the node (the line then gives the ``anet-hub admit`` "
"command for the operator), or whether the hub could not be reached yet, "
"in which case the node keeps trying. The ``Remote control`` line appears "
"only with ``-Controller``. A line beginning with ``Replaced`` appears "
"only when an earlier installation was taken over, and names the directory"
" that now holds its data. A line beginning with ``Note:`` appears only "
"for something that is left to the user, such as a command to run. With "
"``ANET_LANG`` set to a value that begins with ``zh``, the summary is in "
"Chinese."
msgstr ""
"``AID`` 行给出节点的完整身份。``Hub`` 行说明节点是否已加入 hub、hub "
"是否在等待其运营者准入该节点（此时该行给出供运营者运行的 ``anet-hub admit`` 命令），或 hub "
"是否暂时无法连接（此时节点会继续重试）。``Remote control`` 行仅在使用 ``-Controller`` 时出现。以 "
"``Replaced`` 开头的行仅在接管了较早的安装时出现，并注明现保存其数据的目录。以 ``Note:`` "
"开头的行仅在有需要用户处理的事项时出现，例如需要运行的命令。``ANET_LANG`` 设置为以 ``zh`` 开头的值时，摘要以中文显示。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:717
msgid ""
"The last line names the log of the run. The log records everything else: "
"the download sources that were probed and tried, each check, every step "
"of the takeover, the changes to the ``PATH`` and to the ``Run`` value, "
"and the output of ``anet init``, ``anet up``, ``anet doctor`` and ``anet "
"hub-register``. It is written to "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet\\logs\\install-<UTC time>.log``, in a directory "
"with an access control list of its own (full control for the user, SYSTEM"
" and Administrators, and nothing else). When the data directory is not "
"ready for it, because the installation stopped before ``anet init`` or "
"the directory still holds the data of an earlier release, the log is "
"written to ``%TEMP%\\anet-install\\`` instead. A refusal and a failure "
"are reported in a short ``Error:`` line followed by the ``Details:`` "
"line."
msgstr ""
"最后一行注明本次运行的日志。日志记录其余全部内容：探测与尝试过的下载源、每项检查、接管的每个步骤、对 ``PATH`` 与 ``Run`` "
"值的更改，以及 ``anet init``、``anet up``、``anet doctor`` 与 ``anet hub-register``"
" 的输出。日志写入 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet\\logs\\install-<UTC "
"time>.log``，所在目录具有独立的访问控制列表（仅用户、SYSTEM 与 Administrators "
"拥有完全控制权限，其他账户无任何权限）。数据目录尚不可用时（安装在 ``anet init`` "
"之前停止，或该目录仍保存早期版本的数据），日志改为写入 ``%TEMP%\\anet-install\\``。拒绝与失败以一行简短的 "
"``Error:`` 报告，其后为 ``Details:`` 行。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:734
msgid ""
"``install.ps1`` installs exactly the release with which it was published,"
" because it carries the SHA-256 digests of that release. Every download "
"source is therefore asked for that version:"
msgstr "``install.ps1`` 载有其所属发布版本的 SHA-256 摘要，因此只安装该发布版本。每个下载源均按该版本请求："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:738
msgid ""
"The npm mirror ``registry.npmmirror.com`` and the GitHub release of the "
"project (``github.com/ANetResearch/ANet/releases/download/v<version>/``) "
"are probed in parallel, each for at most 3 seconds and for at most 4 "
"seconds in all. The sources that answered are tried first, the faster one"
" first; a source that did not answer is not used."
msgstr ""
"并行探测 npm 镜像 ``registry.npmmirror.com`` 与本项目的 GitHub "
"发布（``github.com/ANetResearch/ANet/releases/download/v<version>/``），每个最多 3"
" 秒，总计最多 4 秒。已响应的下载源优先尝试，响应较快者在前；未响应的下载源不予使用。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:743
msgid "The npm registry ``registry.npmjs.org``."
msgstr "npm 注册表 ``registry.npmjs.org``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:744
msgid "jsDelivr (``cdn.jsdelivr.net``)."
msgstr "jsDelivr（``cdn.jsdelivr.net``）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:745
msgid ""
"The project's hosts ``agentnetwork.org.cn`` and "
"``hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``."
msgstr "本项目的主机 ``agentnetwork.org.cn`` 与 ``hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:747
msgid ""
"From an npm registry, the installer downloads the tarball of the npm "
"package of the build (``@agentnetwork/anet-win32-<cpu>`` or "
"``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-win32-<cpu>``) and reads ``release.json``, its"
" signature and the compressed binary from its ``dl`` directory, in "
"memory. The tarball is refused as a whole when it contains an entry whose"
" name is not a plain relative path, for example one with ``..``; nothing "
"is ever written under the name of an entry. A download from GitHub may be"
" redirected only to ``github.com`` and to hosts under "
"``githubusercontent.com``, and only over HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"从 npm 注册表下载时，安装程序下载该版本 npm 包（``@agentnetwork/anet-win32-<cpu>`` 或 "
"``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-win32-<cpu>``）的压缩包，并在内存中从其 ``dl`` 目录读取 "
"``release.json``、其签名和压缩的二进制文件。压缩包中只要有一个条目的名称不是普通的相对路径（例如含有 "
"``..``），整个压缩包即被拒绝；安装程序从不以条目名称写入任何文件。从 GitHub 下载时，仅允许重定向到 ``github.com`` 及"
" ``githubusercontent.com`` 下的主机，且仅限 HTTPS。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:757
msgid ""
"A source that does not serve the release, because it does not answer, "
"returns an HTTP error, returns a page instead of a file, lacks a file or "
"serves another version, is passed over for the next source in one line. A"
" source only determines where the files come from: every file is checked "
"as described in :ref:`intro-install-windows-checks`, and a file that "
"fails a check ends the installation, whichever source served it. "
"``-Base`` replaces the list of sources, and so does the environment "
"variable ``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` when ``-Base`` is not given."
msgstr ""
"下载源未提供该发布版本时（无响应、返回 HTTP "
"错误、返回网页而非文件、缺少文件或提供其他版本），安装程序以一行说明并改用下一个下载源。下载源只决定文件的来源：每个文件均按 :ref"
":`intro-install-windows-checks` "
"所述进行检查，无论由哪个下载源提供，任一文件未通过检查即终止安装。``-Base`` 替换下载源列表；未指定 ``-Base`` 时，环境变量 "
"``ANET_INSTALL_BASE`` 同样替换该列表。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:767
msgid "Running the command in WSL"
msgstr "在 WSL 中运行该命令"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:769
msgid ""
"Run in a WSL shell, the line installs the Windows build on the Windows "
"host, for the Windows user who runs WSL: that is the computer that the "
"controller is given, and the node runs as a Windows program. The command "
"requires that ``powershell.exe`` can be started from WSL, which WSL "
"interoperability provides and which is enabled by default (``[interop] "
"enabled`` and ``appendWindowsPath`` in ``/etc/wsl.conf``). To install "
"ANet inside the Linux distribution instead, use ``install.sh`` (see :ref"
":`intro-install-script`)."
msgstr ""
"在 WSL 的 shell 中运行时，该命令以运行 WSL 的 Windows 用户身份，在 Windows 主机上安装 Windows "
"版本：控制方获得的正是这台计算机，节点作为 Windows 程序运行。该命令要求能够从 WSL 启动 "
"``powershell.exe``，这由默认启用的 WSL 互操作提供（``/etc/wsl.conf`` 中的 ``[interop] "
"enabled`` 与 ``appendWindowsPath``）。如需在 Linux 发行版内部安装 ANet，请使用 "
"``install.sh``\\ （参见 :ref:`intro-install-script`）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:778
msgid "The install directory"
msgstr "安装目录"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:780
msgid ""
"Without ``-Prefix``, the installer chooses the install directory. It uses"
" the first of the following directories that passes the checks below, and"
" prints one line for each directory it skips, with the reason; the reason"
" names the accounts concerned, and an account that Windows cannot name is"
" shown by its SID followed by ``(unresolved)``:"
msgstr ""
"未指定 ``-Prefix`` "
"时，由安装程序选择安装目录。它使用下列目录中第一个通过下述检查的目录，并为每个跳过的目录输出一行原因；原因中写明相关账户的名称，Windows "
"无法解析名称的账户以其 SID 加 ``(unresolved)`` 表示："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:786
msgid ""
"the directory of an ANet 0.3 or later that is already installed for the "
"user, found on the user's ``PATH`` or in the ``Run`` value below, when "
"that directory holds nothing but the files of that installation "
"(``anet.exe``, its release record and signature, binaries moved aside by "
"an update); a directory that also holds other files is reported and not "
"used;"
msgstr ""
"该用户已安装的 ANet 0.3 或更高版本所在的目录（通过用户的 ``PATH`` 或下文的 ``Run`` "
"值找到），且该目录仅包含该安装的文件（``anet.exe``、其发布记录与签名、更新时移至一旁的二进制文件）；同时包含其他文件的目录会被报告且不使用；"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:792
msgid "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``;"
msgstr "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\anet``；"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:793
msgid ""
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin``, beside the runtime directory "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\run`` of the node;"
msgstr "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\bin``，与节点的运行时目录 ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\run`` 相邻；"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:795
msgid "``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin``."
msgstr "``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-bin``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:797
msgid ""
"A directory passes when no directory above it grants another account the "
"right to rename it or to change its access control list, and when it is "
"private to the user: it is owned by the user, SYSTEM or Administrators, "
"and no access control entry grants another account more than "
"synchronization, traversal and reading attributes. Such entries, for "
"example the one that Windows grants an app container capability on the "
"profile directory, give no access to the contents and are ignored. An "
"entry that grants listing or reading, writing or appending, creating "
"files or subdirectories, deletion, reading or changing permissions, "
"taking ownership, or a generic right fails the check. A directory that "
"does not exist yet is checked through the nearest directory above it, and"
" each missing level is created with an access control list of its own: "
"full control for the user, SYSTEM and Administrators, and nothing else. "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet`` is created in this way when the third directory "
"is used, and the node accepts it as the parent of its runtime directory."
msgstr ""
"目录须满足以下条件方可通过检查：其上层的任何目录均未向其他账户授予重命名该目录或更改其访问控制列表的权限；该目录为当前用户私有，即其所有者为当前用户、SYSTEM"
" 或 Administrators，且没有任何访问控制项向其他账户授予超出同步、遍历与读取属性的权限。此类访问控制项（例如 Windows "
"在用户配置文件目录上授予应用容器功能的访问控制项）不提供对内容的任何访问，因此被忽略。授予列出或读取、写入或追加、创建文件或子目录、删除、读取或更改权限、取得所有权或通用权限的访问控制项不能通过检查。尚不存在的目录依据其最近的已存在上级目录检查，缺失的每一级目录在创建时设置其自己的访问控制列表：当前用户、SYSTEM"
" 与 Administrators 拥有完全控制权限，此外没有任何其他项。使用第三个目录时，``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet`` "
"即以这种方式创建，节点接受其作为运行时目录的上级目录。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:813
msgid ""
"``-Prefix`` overrides the choice. The given directory is subject to the "
"same checks, and a directory that fails them is refused."
msgstr "``-Prefix`` 覆盖上述选择。所指定的目录接受相同的检查，未通过检查的目录会被拒绝。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:819
msgid "An elevated window"
msgstr "提升权限的窗口"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:821
msgid ""
"An elevated window is not refused. ANet is installed for the current "
"account, with the same per-user directories, ``PATH`` and ``Run`` value "
"as in a window that is not elevated. The parameter ``-Elevated`` is "
"accepted for compatibility and has no effect."
msgstr ""
"安装程序不拒绝提升权限的窗口。ANet 为当前账户安装，所用的按用户目录、``PATH`` 与 ``Run`` "
"值与未提升权限的窗口相同。为保持兼容，参数 ``-Elevated`` 仍被接受，但不产生任何作用。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:826
msgid ""
"While Windows has a standard user token for the account, that is, while "
"User Account Control is on, the elevated window has more rights than the "
"programs of the account normally run with, and the installer does not run"
" the programs of the account from it: an earlier ``anet.exe`` found on "
"the ``PATH`` is classified by its contents without being run, its "
"``stop`` command and ``npm`` are not run, and the commands are printed "
"instead, to be run in a normal window of the account. PowerShell itself "
"still loads its modules from the account's ``Documents`` folder before "
"the script runs; this is one more reason to run the command in a normal "
"window."
msgstr ""
"当 Windows "
"为该账户提供标准用户令牌时，即用户账户控制开启时，提升权限的窗口拥有的权限高于该账户的程序通常运行时的权限，因此安装程序不从该窗口运行该账户的任何程序：在"
" ``PATH`` 中找到的较早 ``anet.exe`` 按其文件内容分类而不运行，其 ``stop`` 命令与 ``npm`` "
"不运行，相应命令仅输出，供在该账户的普通窗口中运行。PowerShell 本身仍会在脚本运行之前从该账户的 ``Documents`` "
"文件夹加载其模块，这也是应在普通窗口中运行该命令的原因之一。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:836
msgid ""
"The node is never started with the elevated token in that case. The "
"installer registers a one-time task in the Task Scheduler for the current"
" user, with the interactive token and the least privileges, runs ``anet "
"up`` through it and deletes the task; tasks that an earlier run left "
"behind are removed at the start. When the task cannot run or does not "
"complete within 30 seconds, for example because the Task Scheduler is "
"unavailable or the user is not logged on interactively, the node is not "
"started: the installation ends with exit status 3, the ``Run`` value is "
"written unless ``-NoAutostart`` is given, so that the node starts at the "
"next logon, and the commands that start it now (``anet up``, then ``anet "
"hub-register`` unless ``-NoJoin`` is given) are printed for a normal "
"window. The controller's commands are therefore run with the user's "
"rights, never with the administrator's."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，节点绝不以提升后的令牌启动。安装程序在任务计划程序中为当前用户注册一个一次性任务，该任务使用交互式令牌与最低权限，通过该任务运行 "
"``anet up``，然后删除该任务；先前运行遗留的任务在开始时清除。若该任务无法运行或在 30 "
"秒内未完成，例如任务计划程序不可用或用户未以交互方式登录，则节点不启动：安装以退出状态 3 结束；除非指定 "
"``-NoAutostart``，否则写入 ``Run`` 值，使节点在下次登录时启动；并输出现在启动节点所需的命令（``anet "
"up``，然后是 ``anet hub-register``，除非指定 "
"``-NoJoin``），供在普通窗口中运行。因此，控制者的命令始终以用户的权限运行，绝不以管理员的权限运行。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:849
msgid ""
"An elevated window that runs as an account other than the one logged on "
"to the session, which is the case when another account's credentials are "
"given to the User Account Control prompt, is refused before anything is "
"changed: ANet would be installed for that other account, and its node "
"would run as that account in the user's session. Run the command in a "
"normal window of your own account."
msgstr ""
"若提升权限的窗口以登录到当前会话的账户之外的账户运行（在用户账户控制提示中输入了其他账户的凭据即属此情形），则安装在更改任何内容之前被拒绝：否则 "
"ANet 将为该其他账户安装，其节点将在用户的会话中以该账户运行。请在您自己账户的普通窗口中运行该命令。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:856
msgid ""
"When Windows has no standard user token for the account, because User "
"Account Control is off or the account is the built-in Administrator, the "
"window has the rights the account always has: earlier installations are "
"taken over as in any other window, the node is started directly with the "
"rights of the window, and the installer says so in one line."
msgstr ""
"若 Windows 未为该账户提供标准用户令牌（用户账户控制已关闭，或该账户为内置 "
"Administrator），则该窗口拥有的权限即为该账户始终拥有的权限：较早的安装与在其他窗口中一样被接管，节点直接以窗口的权限启动，安装程序以一行文字说明这一情况。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:867
msgid ""
"The installer takes over from other ANet installations of the user, "
"without asking, in an order that leaves a consistent state when a step "
"fails:"
msgstr "安装程序接管该用户的其他 ANet 安装，不进行询问，且执行顺序保证某一步失败时仍处于一致状态："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:870
msgid ""
"An ``anet.exe`` found on the machine's or the user's ``PATH`` is "
"recognized by the Go module path in the file: that of AgentNetwork 1.x "
"(``ChatChatTech/AgentNetwork``) or that of this project. The npm package "
"``@agentnetwork/anet`` in the global npm prefix (``npm prefix -g``) is "
"recognized by its ``package.json``: its name, a version in the form "
"``x.y.z``, and the ``repository`` field or the version, as ``install.sh``"
" does. A file named ``anet.exe`` that is not a program of either project "
"is reported and never run."
msgstr ""
"在计算机或用户的 ``PATH`` 中找到的 ``anet.exe`` 按文件中的 Go 模块路径识别：AgentNetwork 1.x "
"的模块路径（``ChatChatTech/AgentNetwork``）或本项目的模块路径。全局 npm 前缀（``npm prefix "
"-g``）中的 npm 包 ``@agentnetwork/anet`` 按其 ``package.json`` 识别：包名、``x.y.z`` "
"形式的版本，以及 ``repository`` 字段或版本，与 ``install.sh`` 相同。名为 ``anet.exe`` "
"但不属于这两个项目的文件仅予报告，永不运行。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:878
msgid ""
"An ANet of the earlier line is stopped with its own ``stop`` command, "
"with a time limit; the binary that is run must carry the module path of "
"AgentNetwork 1.x."
msgstr ""
"较早系列的 ANet 以其自身的 ``stop`` 命令停止，并设有时间限制；所运行的二进制文件必须载有 AgentNetwork 1.x "
"的模块路径。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:881
msgid ""
"When a daemon of AgentNetwork 1.x still holds the data directory, the "
"installer stops it: a daemon is the process named in ``daemon.pid``, or "
"the process that listens on ``127.0.0.1:3998``, and only when its program"
" carries the module path of AgentNetwork 1.x. A daemon of ANet 0.3 or "
"later, or another program that reuses the process ID of a stale "
"``daemon.pid``, is never taken for one. The installer first asks the "
"daemon to shut down through its local API, with the API token from the "
"data directory, as the ``stop`` command of 1.x does, and waits up to 10 "
"seconds; a daemon that is still running is then ended by its process ID, "
"after its program has been checked again. The installer never ends a "
"process by name."
msgstr ""
"AgentNetwork 1.x 的守护进程仍占用数据目录时，安装程序将其停止：守护进程是指 ``daemon.pid`` 中记录的进程或监听 "
"``127.0.0.1:3998`` 的进程，且仅当其程序载有 AgentNetwork 1.x 的模块路径时才予认定。ANet 0.3 "
"或更高版本的守护进程，以及沿用过期 ``daemon.pid`` 中进程 ID 的其他程序，绝不会被认定为此类守护进程。安装程序首先与 1.x 的"
" ``stop`` 命令一样，使用数据目录中的 API 令牌，通过其本地 API 请求守护进程关闭，并最多等待 10 "
"秒；若守护进程仍在运行，则在再次检查其程序后按进程 ID 将其终止。安装程序绝不按名称终止进程。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:891
msgid ""
"Its data in ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` (or ``ANET_DATA_DIR``) is moved "
"aside, never deleted, by the same rule as ``install.sh`` and the daemon "
"(see :ref:`intro-install-earlier`). A directory with the identity file of"
" 0.2, or with the files of 1.x and no identity of 0.3, is renamed to "
"``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-legacy-<version>-<UTC time>``. A directory with "
"the files of 1.x and an identity of 0.3 (``identity.kel``, or "
"``ids\\<name>\\identity.kel`` of this version) stays in place, and only "
"the 1.x entries (``anet``, ``anet.db`` and its journals, ``api_token``, "
"``agent_token``, ``scoped_tokens.json``, ``peer-journal.json``, ``cas``, "
"``orgs``, ``state`` and ``daemon.pid``) are moved into a directory of "
"that name. A directory of 0.3, of a newer release, or whose identity file"
" does not read is not changed."
msgstr ""
"其位于 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet``\\ （或 ``ANET_DATA_DIR``）的数据按与 ``install.sh`` "
"及守护进程相同的规则移至别处，绝不删除（参见 :ref:`intro-install-earlier`）。含 0.2 身份文件的目录，或含 1.x"
" 文件且无 0.3 身份的目录，重命名为 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet-legacy-<版本>-<UTC 时间>``。含 1.x "
"文件且含 0.3 身份（``identity.kel``，或本版本的 ``ids\\<名称>\\identity.kel``）的目录保留原处，仅将"
" 1.x 条目（``anet``、``anet.db`` "
"及其日志文件、``api_token``、``agent_token``、``scoped_tokens.json``、``peer-"
"journal.json``、``cas``、``orgs``、``state`` 与 ``daemon.pid``）移入同名目录。0.3 "
"的目录、更新版本的目录或身份文件无法读取的目录不作更改。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:903
msgid ""
"Only after the data has been moved is the npm package removed with ``npm "
"uninstall -g @agentnetwork/anet``. When that is not possible, the "
"installer prints the command to run."
msgstr ""
"数据移动完成后，才通过 ``npm uninstall -g @agentnetwork/anet`` 卸载 npm "
"包。无法卸载时，安装程序输出需要运行的命令。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:906
msgid ""
"Another installation of ANet 0.3 or later outside npm is left in place. "
"Its directory is taken off the user's ``PATH`` only when it holds nothing"
" but the files of that installation; a directory that also holds other "
"programs stays on the ``PATH`` and is reported. The npm launcher of 0.3 "
"or later is left alone."
msgstr ""
"npm 之外的其他 ANet 0.3 或更高版本安装保留原处。仅当其目录只包含该安装的文件时，才将该目录从用户的 ``PATH`` "
"中移除；同时包含其他程序的目录保留在 ``PATH`` 中并予以报告。0.3 或更高版本的 npm 启动器不受影响。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:912
msgid ""
"The data directory is moved in this way whether or not an earlier "
"installation was found, as ``install.sh`` does, once no daemon holds it. "
"When it holds the data of an earlier release but cannot be moved, because"
" its daemon could not be stopped or because the move failed, the "
"installation stops before ``anet init``: nothing in that directory is "
"changed, the npm package stays, the exit status is 3, and the installer "
"prints the exact commands that remain, in order (stopping the earlier "
"daemon, renaming the directory, removing the package, ``anet init``, the "
"grant, ``anet up`` and the hub registration)."
msgstr ""
"无论是否找到较早的安装，只要没有守护进程占用该数据目录，均按此方式移动，与 ``install.sh`` "
"相同。若数据目录含有早期版本的数据但无法移动，原因可能是其守护进程无法停止或移动失败，则安装在 ``anet init`` "
"之前停止：该目录中的任何内容均不更改，npm 包保留，退出状态为 "
"3，安装程序按顺序输出剩余的确切命令（停止早期守护进程、重命名目录、卸载包、``anet init``、授权、``anet up`` 与 hub "
"注册）。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:922
msgid ""
"The install directory is put first on the user's ``PATH``. The installer "
"then starts a new ``powershell.exe`` with the ``PATH`` that a new window "
"receives and reports in one line which ``anet`` it runs. A directory on "
"the machine's ``PATH`` precedes the user's ``PATH``; an earlier ``anet`` "
"there is reported in a ``Note:`` line. The summary reports a takeover in "
"one line; what was stopped, moved and removed is recorded in the log."
msgstr ""
"安装目录置于用户 ``PATH`` 的首位。随后，安装程序以新窗口所得的 ``PATH`` 启动一个新的 "
"``powershell.exe``，并以一行文字报告其运行的是哪个 ``anet``。计算机 ``PATH`` 中的目录位于用户 "
"``PATH`` 之前；其中若有较早的 ``anet``，则在 ``Note:`` "
"行中报告。摘要以一行报告接管情况；已停止、已移动与已卸载的内容记录在日志中。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:934
msgid ""
"The one-line command trusts the host that serves ``install.ps1`` and its "
"TLS certificate. To avoid that trust, download the script and its "
"signature, verify the signature with the release key, and run the "
"verified copy."
msgstr ""
"单行命令信任提供 ``install.ps1`` 的主机及其 TLS "
"证书。若不愿信任该主机，请下载脚本及其签名，用发布密钥验证签名，然后运行已验证的副本。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:938
msgid ""
"The signature is checked with ``ssh-keygen -Y verify`` from OpenSSH 8.1 "
"or later (``ssh -V`` prints the version). The following block, for a "
"PowerShell window, writes the file ``allowed_signers`` with the release "
"key line given in :ref:`intro-install-verify` as UTF-8 without a byte "
"order mark, which ``ssh-keygen`` requires; the ``>`` redirection of "
"Windows PowerShell 5.1 writes UTF-16. It runs the check in ``cmd.exe``, "
"which provides the input redirection that PowerShell lacks, and stops "
"before running the script when the signature does not verify:"
msgstr ""
"签名使用 OpenSSH 8.1 或更高版本的 ``ssh-keygen -Y verify`` 检查（``ssh -V`` "
"输出版本号）。以下代码块用于 PowerShell 窗口，它以不带字节顺序标记的 UTF-8 写入文件 "
"``allowed_signers``，内容为 :ref:`intro-install-verify` 中给出的发布密钥行，这是 ``ssh-"
"keygen`` 的要求；Windows PowerShell 5.1 的 ``>`` 重定向写出 UTF-16。代码块在提供输入重定向的 "
"``cmd.exe`` 中执行检查（PowerShell 不支持输入重定向），签名验证未通过时在运行脚本之前停止："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:954
msgid ""
"When this computer has an older OpenSSH, copy ``install.ps1``, "
"``install.ps1.sig`` and ``allowed_signers`` to a computer with OpenSSH "
"8.1 or later and run the check there. The command is the same in "
"``cmd.exe`` and in a POSIX shell:"
msgstr ""
"本机的 OpenSSH 版本低于 8.1 时，请将 ``install.ps1``\\ 、\\ ``install.ps1.sig`` 与 "
"``allowed_signers`` 复制到装有 OpenSSH 8.1 或更高版本的计算机上执行检查。该命令在 ``cmd.exe`` 与 "
"POSIX shell 中相同："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:963
msgid ""
"A successful check prints ``Good \"anet-release@agentnetwork.org.cn\" "
"signature`` followed by the key fingerprint. Only then run the verified "
"copy in PowerShell, in the directory that holds it:"
msgstr ""
"检查成功时会输出 ``Good \"anet-release@agentnetwork.org.cn\" "
"signature``，后接密钥指纹。仅在此之后，才在 PowerShell 中，于保存该副本的目录内运行已验证的副本："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:971
msgid ""
"Run in an open PowerShell window in this way, the script leaves the "
"window open and sets ``$LASTEXITCODE`` to the result."
msgstr "以这种方式在已打开的 PowerShell 窗口中运行时，脚本不会关闭该窗口，并将 ``$LASTEXITCODE`` 设为安装结果。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:975
msgid "Installer parameters"
msgstr "安装程序参数"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:981
msgid "Parameter"
msgstr "参数"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:983
msgid "``-Controller <AID>``"
msgstr "``-Controller <AID>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:984
msgid ""
"Install the build with the ``shell`` module and give exactly this AID "
"access to it (see :ref:`intro-install-windows-controller`). The parameter"
" is the consent to the grant."
msgstr ""
"安装含 ``shell`` 模块的版本，仅向该 AID 授予访问权限（参见 :ref:`intro-install-windows-"
"controller`）。该参数即为对授权的同意。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:987
msgid "``-Shell``"
msgstr "``-Shell``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:988
msgid "Install the build with the ``shell`` module. No caller is given access."
msgstr "安装含 ``shell`` 模块的版本。不向任何调用方授予访问权限。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:989
msgid "``-Hub <URL>``"
msgstr "``-Hub <URL>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:990
msgid ""
"Register with the hub at ``URL`` instead of "
"``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``."
msgstr "注册到位于 ``URL`` 的 hub，而非 ``https://hub.agentnetwork.org.cn``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:992
msgid "``-NoJoin``"
msgstr "``-NoJoin``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:993
msgid ""
"Start the node, but do not register with a hub. Register later with "
"``anet hub-register``."
msgstr "启动节点，但不注册到 hub。之后可使用 ``anet hub-register`` 注册。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:995
msgid "``-NoStart``"
msgstr "``-NoStart``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:996
msgid ""
"Neither start the node nor register with a hub. Start the node later with"
" ``anet up``."
msgstr "既不启动节点，也不注册到 hub。之后可使用 ``anet up`` 启动节点。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:998
msgid "``-Name <name>``"
msgstr "``-Name <name>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:999
msgid "The name to register under. The default is the computer name."
msgstr "注册所用的名称，默认为计算机名。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1000
msgid "``-Prefix <directory>``"
msgstr "``-Prefix <directory>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1001
msgid ""
"Install to this absolute directory instead of the directory the installer"
" chooses. The directory must pass the checks of the chosen directories. A"
" directory name that contains ``;`` or ``%`` is refused."
msgstr "安装到该绝对路径目录，而不是安装程序选择的目录。该目录必须通过与自动选择的目录相同的检查。目录名中含有 ``;`` 或 ``%`` 时会被拒绝。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1004
msgid "``-Without <modules>``"
msgstr "``-Without <modules>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1005
msgid ""
"Switch off the listed modules in the configuration, as ``install.sh "
"--without`` does (see :ref:`intro-install-modules`). The configuration is"
" changed after the binary is installed."
msgstr ""
"在配置中关闭所列模块，与 ``install.sh --without`` 相同（参见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"modules`）。配置在二进制文件安装完成后才会修改。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1008
msgid "``-Base <URL or directory>``"
msgstr "``-Base <URL or directory>``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1009
msgid ""
"Download from this ``https://`` address, or read a release from this "
"local directory, instead of the download sources. Every check is the "
"same."
msgstr "从该 ``https://`` 地址下载，或从该本地目录读取发布版本，而不使用各下载源。所有检查均相同。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1012
msgid "``-NoAutostart``"
msgstr "``-NoAutostart``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1013
msgid "Do not write the value that starts the node at logon."
msgstr "不写入登录时启动节点的注册表值。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1014
msgid "``-NoPath``"
msgstr "``-NoPath``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1015
msgid "Do not put the installation directory on the user's ``PATH``."
msgstr "不将安装目录加入用户的 ``PATH``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1016
msgid "``-Elevated``"
msgstr "``-Elevated``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1017
msgid "Accepted for compatibility with 0.3.4; it has no effect."
msgstr "为与 0.3.4 兼容而保留，不产生任何作用。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1019
msgid ""
"The download sources are described in :ref:`intro-install-windows-"
"sources`. The npm packages of the Windows builds are ``@agentnetwork"
"/anet-win32-<cpu>`` and ``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-win32-<cpu>``."
msgstr ""
"下载源参见 :ref:`intro-install-windows-sources`。Windows 版本的 npm 包为 "
"``@agentnetwork/anet-win32-<cpu>`` 与 ``@agentnetwork/anet-shell-"
"win32-<cpu>``\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1024
msgid "Paths"
msgstr "路径"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1030
msgid "Item"
msgstr "项目"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1032
msgid "Binary"
msgstr "二进制文件"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1033
msgid ""
"``anet.exe`` in the install directory (see above), with the release "
"manifest ``anet.exe.release.json`` and its signature "
"``anet.exe.release.json.sig`` beside it."
msgstr ""
"安装目录（见上文）中的 ``anet.exe``，其旁边存放发布清单 ``anet.exe.release.json`` 及其签名 "
"``anet.exe.release.json.sig``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1036
msgid "Data directory"
msgstr "数据目录"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1037
msgid "``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet``"
msgstr "``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1038
msgid "Runtime directory"
msgstr "运行时目录"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1039
msgid "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\run``"
msgstr "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\run``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1040
msgid "Start at logon"
msgstr "登录时启动"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1041
msgid ""
"The value ``AgentNetwork`` under "
"``HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run``. Removing the"
" value stops the start at logon."
msgstr ""
"``HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run`` 下的值 "
"``AgentNetwork``。删除该值即不再于登录时启动。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1048
msgid "What the installer checks"
msgstr "安装程序检查的内容"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1050
msgid ""
"``install.ps1`` is signed (``install.ps1.sig``) and carries the SHA-256 "
"digests of the Windows release binaries."
msgstr ""
"``install.ps1`` 已签名（\\ ``install.ps1.sig``），并载有 Windows 发布二进制文件的 SHA-256 "
"摘要。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1052
msgid ""
"Nothing that is downloaded is run or installed before it matches those "
"digests."
msgstr "下载的任何内容在与这些摘要一致之前，都不会被运行或安装。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1054
msgid ""
"The downloaded binary then verifies, with the release key built into it, "
"the signature of ``release.json``, its expiry, its version, the SHA-256 "
"digest of the binary itself and its module set, and it refuses a "
"downgrade."
msgstr ""
"随后，下载的二进制文件使用其内置的发布密钥，验证 ``release.json`` 的签名、有效期、版本、二进制文件自身的 SHA-256 "
"摘要及其模块集合，并拒绝降级。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1057
msgid "No option skips a check."
msgstr "没有任何选项可以跳过检查。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1062
msgid "What ``-Controller`` opens"
msgstr "``-Controller`` 开放的内容"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1064
msgid "``-Controller`` opens exactly the following, and nothing else:"
msgstr "``-Controller`` 仅开放以下各项，不开放其他任何内容："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1066
msgid ""
"The build with the ``shell`` module is installed instead of the default "
"build."
msgstr "安装含 ``shell`` 模块的版本，而非默认版本。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1068
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The configuration block ``modules.shell = "
"{\"allow\":[\"<AID>\"],\"allow_arbitrary\":true,\"shell\":\"powershell\"}``."
msgstr ""
"配置块 ``modules.shell = "
"{\"allow\":[\"<AID>\"],\"allow_arbitrary\":true,\"shell\":\"powershell\"}``\\"
" 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1070
msgid "The AID on ``peers.allow``."
msgstr "``peers.allow`` 中的该 AID。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1072
msgid ""
"Everything else is what every installation does: the defaults of ``anet "
"init`` (the inbound policy ``closed``, no public capabilities and "
"spending limits of 0, see :ref:`intro-install-init`), the start of the "
"node, the ``Run`` value that starts it at every logon unless "
"``-NoAutostart`` is given, and the registration with the hub unless "
"``-NoJoin`` or ``-NoStart`` is given. No auto-reply, no other peer, no "
"public capability and no listener beyond the node's loopback ones are "
"opened. The install directory, the ``PATH`` and the takeover of earlier "
"installations are the same with and without ``-Controller``."
msgstr ""
"其余均为每次安装都会进行的操作：``anet init`` 的默认设置（入站策略 ``closed``、无公开能力、支出上限为 0，参见 :ref"
":`intro-install-init`）、启动节点、除非指定 ``-NoAutostart`` 否则写入在每次登录时启动节点的 ``Run``"
" 值，以及除非指定 ``-NoJoin`` 或 ``-NoStart`` 否则注册到 "
"hub。不开启自动回复、其他对等节点、公开能力，也不开启节点回环监听之外的任何监听。安装目录、``PATH`` "
"以及对较早安装的接管，在使用与不使用 ``-Controller`` 时均相同。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1082
msgid ""
"Up to version 0.3.4, the installer asked one confirmation on the console."
" That confirmation is removed: the parameter on the command line is the "
"consent, and the installer runs ``anet init --shell-controller <AID> "
"--yes``. Run without ``--yes`` in a terminal, ``anet init --shell-"
"controller`` still asks the confirmation. Access is revoked with ``anet "
"peers remove <AID>`` and by removing the ``modules.shell`` block from "
"``config.json``, followed by a restart of the node. The summary gives the"
" first command, which takes effect at once; the log gives both steps. The"
" shell module on Windows is described in :ref:`topics-shell-windows`."
msgstr ""
"0.3.4 及更早版本的安装程序会在控制台上请求一次确认。该确认已移除：命令行中的参数即为同意，安装程序运行 ``anet init "
"--shell-controller <AID> --yes``。在终端中不带 ``--yes`` 运行时，``anet init "
"--shell-controller`` 仍会请求确认。撤销访问权限的方法是运行 ``anet peers remove <AID>``，并从 "
"``config.json`` 中删除 ``modules.shell`` "
"块，然后重启节点。摘要给出第一个命令，该命令立即生效；日志给出两个步骤。Windows 上的 shell 模块参见 :ref:`topics-"
"shell-windows`。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1093
msgid "Background operation"
msgstr "后台运行"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1095
msgid ""
"``anet up`` starts the daemon detached from the console. The daemon keeps"
" running when the window is closed, stops at logoff, and starts again at "
"logon through the ``Run`` value above. It runs as the logged-on user and "
"never as a Windows service."
msgstr ""
"``anet up`` 以脱离控制台的方式启动守护进程。关闭窗口后守护进程继续运行，注销时停止，登录时通过上述 ``Run`` "
"值再次启动。它以已登录用户的身份运行，从不作为 Windows 服务运行。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1101
msgid "Updating on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上更新"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1103
msgid ""
"``anet update`` applies the checks described in :ref:`intro-install-"
"update`. A running ``anet.exe`` cannot be overwritten, so the update "
"renames it aside and puts the new binary in its place. The daemon keeps "
"the old binary until it is restarted. Windows PowerShell 5.1 has no "
"``&&`` operator; run the two commands one after the other:"
msgstr ""
"``anet update`` 执行 :ref:`intro-install-update` 所述的检查。运行中的 ``anet.exe`` "
"无法被覆盖，因此更新会将其重命名到一旁，再将新二进制文件放到原位置。守护进程在重启之前继续使用旧的二进制文件。Windows PowerShell"
" 5.1 没有 ``&&`` 运算符；请依次运行以下两条命令："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1114
msgid ""
"Running the one-line command again also updates an installation; it "
"reuses the install directory of the existing installation when that "
"directory passes the checks. A node that runs an earlier version is "
"stopped and started again with the new binary; with ``-NoStart``, it "
"keeps running, and the summary gives the commands that restart it."
msgstr ""
"再次运行这一行命令同样会更新安装；若现有安装的目录通过检查，则继续使用该目录。运行较早版本的节点会被停止，并以新的二进制文件重新启动；使用 "
"``-NoStart`` 时，该节点继续运行，摘要给出重启它的命令。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1121
msgid "Uninstalling on Windows"
msgstr "在 Windows 上卸载"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1123
msgid "Stop the daemons with ``anet stop --all``."
msgstr "用 ``anet stop --all`` 停止各守护进程。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1124
msgid ""
"Remove the value ``AgentNetwork`` under "
"``HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run``."
msgstr ""
"删除 ``HKCU\\Software\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\Run`` 下的值 "
"``AgentNetwork``。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1126
msgid ""
"Delete the install directory; ``(Get-Command anet).Source`` names the "
"binary in it."
msgstr "删除安装目录；``(Get-Command anet).Source`` 显示其中二进制文件的路径。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1128
msgid "Remove that directory from the user's ``PATH``."
msgstr "从用户的 ``PATH`` 中移除该目录。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1130
msgid ""
"The data directory ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` holds the identity. Delete it"
" only deliberately, as described in :ref:`intro-install-remove`."
msgstr ""
"数据目录 ``%USERPROFILE%\\.anet`` 保存身份。仅在确有意图时删除，方法见 :ref:`intro-install-"
"remove`。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1136
msgid "Installing with npm"
msgstr "使用 npm 安装"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1138
msgid ""
"The npm package ``@agentnetwork/anet`` runs the same release binary. It "
"needs Node.js 18 or later:"
msgstr "npm 包 ``@agentnetwork/anet`` 运行相同的发布二进制文件，需要 Node.js 18 或更高版本："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1146
msgid ""
"The package contains a launcher and no binary. The build of the platform "
"is in the optional dependency ``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>``, as the "
"archive and the signed release manifest. Before the first run of a "
"version, the launcher checks that ``release.json`` carries a valid "
"signature by the ANet release key (the file ``allowed_signers`` of the "
"package) and names the version of the package, and that the SHA-256 "
"digests of the archive and of the binary equal the digests in the "
"manifest. A failure of any check stops the launcher before anything is "
"run. The checked binary is written, with the manifest and its signature, "
"to ``~/.cache/anet/npm/<version>/`` "
"(``~/Library/Caches/anet/npm/<version>/`` on macOS, "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\npm\\<version>`` on Windows, or below "
"``XDG_CACHE_HOME`` when it is set) and is run from there."
msgstr ""
"该包包含一个启动器，不含二进制文件。当前平台的构建位于可选依赖 ``@agentnetwork/anet-<os>-<cpu>`` "
"中，形式为归档和已签名的发布清单。某个版本首次运行之前，启动器检查 ``release.json`` 带有 ANet 发布密钥（包中的 "
"``allowed_signers`` 文件）的有效签名并注明该包的版本，且归档及二进制文件的 SHA-256 "
"摘要与清单中的摘要一致。任何一项检查失败，启动器都会在运行任何程序之前停止。通过检查的二进制文件连同清单及其签名写入 "
"``~/.cache/anet/npm/<version>/``\\ （macOS 上为 "
"``~/Library/Caches/anet/npm/<version>/``\\ ；Windows 上为 "
"``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\anet\\npm\\<version>``\\ ；设置了 ``XDG_CACHE_HOME`` "
"时位于其下），并从该处运行。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1159
msgid ""
"Update the package with ``npm update --global @agentnetwork/anet``. Do "
"not run ``anet update`` on an installation from npm: the launcher runs "
"the version of the package and replaces a changed binary with that "
"version on its next run. Installations with ``--omit=optional`` lack the "
"build and are refused with a message. The variant with the ``shell`` "
"module is not available through the launcher; install it with "
"``install.sh --shell``, or on Windows with ``install.ps1 -Shell``."
msgstr ""
"使用 ``npm update --global @agentnetwork/anet`` 更新该包。不要对通过 npm 安装的 ``anet``"
" 运行 ``anet update``\\ ：启动器运行的是该包的版本，下次运行时会以该版本替换已变更的二进制文件。使用 "
"``--omit=optional`` 的安装缺少构建，启动器会给出提示并拒绝运行。启动器不提供包含 ``shell`` 模块的变体；请使用 "
"``install.sh --shell`` 安装，Windows 上请使用 ``install.ps1 -Shell``\\ 。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1167
msgid ""
"The package also contains ``install.sh`` and ``install.sh.sig``, so that "
"the installer can be obtained from npm when the project hosts cannot be "
"reached, for example from "
"``https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@agentnetwork/anet@latest/install.sh``. "
"Verify it as described in :ref:`intro-install-verify` before running it."
msgstr ""
"该包还包含 ``install.sh`` 和 ``install.sh.sig``\\ ，以便在项目主机不可达时从 npm 获取安装程序，例如 "
"``https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@agentnetwork/anet@latest/install.sh``\\ "
"。运行之前，请按 :ref:`intro-install-verify` 所述进行验证。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1175
msgid "Checking the installation"
msgstr "检查安装"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1177
msgid ""
"``anet version`` prints the version and the modules that the binary "
"contains. The list is read from the module registry of the running "
"binary, not from a string written at build time."
msgstr "``anet version`` 输出版本以及二进制文件所含的模块。该列表读取自正在运行的二进制文件的模块注册表，而不是构建时写入的字符串。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1191
msgid "Initial configuration"
msgstr "初始配置"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1193
msgid ""
"``anet init`` writes the safe defaults explicitly into ``config.json`` in"
" the data directory, so that each value is visible and changeable instead"
" of existing only as a built-in default. The command is idempotent. It "
"adds keys that are missing and never changes a value that exists. "
"Settings that differ from a fresh installation are listed in its report "
"and left for the operator to decide."
msgstr ""
"``anet init`` 将安全的默认值明确写入数据目录中的 "
"``config.json``，使每个值都可见、可更改，而不是仅作为内置默认值存在。该命令是幂等的：它添加缺失的键，从不更改已存在的值。与全新安装不同的设置会列在其报告中，由运维者自行决定。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1213
msgid "The written values are:"
msgstr "写入的值如下："

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1219
msgid "Key"
msgstr "键"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1220
msgid "Value"
msgstr "值"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1222
msgid "``inbound.policy``"
msgstr "``inbound.policy``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1223
msgid "``closed``"
msgstr "``closed``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1224
msgid "Only peers on the allow or trust list can send tasks."
msgstr "只有允许列表或信任列表中的对端可以发送任务。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1225
