msgid "``autoreply``"
msgstr "``autoreply``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1346
msgid ""
"Answering tasks with a local agent, including the sandbox, the credential"
" injection route, the egress allow list and the budgets."
msgstr "以本地 Agent 应答任务，包括沙箱、凭据注入路由、出站允许列表和预算。"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1348
msgid "``blackboard``"
msgstr "``blackboard``"

#: ../../intro/install.rst:1349
